<view class="cat-start-page">
  <view class="back-btn" bindtap="goBack">
    <image class="icon-img" src="/assets/profile-icons/arrowleft-dark.png" mode="aspectFit" />
  </view>

  <view class="bg-decoration bg-decoration-1"></view>
  <view class="bg-decoration bg-decoration-2"></view>

  <view class="content">
    <view class="illustration">
      <view class="illustration-bg">
        <image class="paw-layer paw-back" src="/assets/logo.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <image class="paw-layer paw-front" src="/assets/logo.png" mode="aspectFit" />
        <text class="sparkle sparkle-1">✨</text>
        <text class="sparkle sparkle-2">✨</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <text class="main-title">还没有猫咪伙伴</text>
    <text class="main-desc">每一个温暖的灵魂都在等待相遇。
开启一段专属缘分，领养你的第一只数字猫咪吧。</text>
    <view class="start-btn" bindtap="start">
      <text class="start-btn-text">开启缘分</text>
      <text class="start-btn-arrow">→</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="footer"><text class="footer-text">MIAO SANCTUARY · PURE COMPANIONSHIP</text></view>
</view>
